Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Mandelbrot Set", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.941181117883933*^9, 
  3.94118113488958*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"784a2d75-962d-47c0-a4f2-\
d285a6d7d95b"],

Cell["\<\
By further change of variables, the logistic map can be put into a from \
called The Quadratic Map.
If we plot the bifurcation diagram again, we see it\[CloseCurlyQuote]s \
equivalent.\
